*
!*.md
!LICENSE
!.gitattributes
!.github/
!.github/**
!skills/
!templates/
!templates/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!skills.txt
# This repo's own hook (dogfooding). Re-ignore .md files
# directly under .claude/ - the global !*.md above would otherwise unignore
# any stray one (e.g. a reverted dogfooding skip regenerating CLAUDE.md).
!.claude/
.claude/*.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
# Allowlist each native skill dir explicitly (not a blanket !skills/**).
# When consumed as a .claude subtree, a blanket unignore here would also
# unignore session-installed skill caches the consumer repo means to ignore.
# Add two lines here for every new skill added under skills/ (push hook checks).
!skills/craft-prompt/
!skills/craft-prompt/**
!skills/grill-with-docs/
!skills/grill-with-docs/**
!skills/handoff/
!skills/handoff/**
!skills/improve-codebase-architecture/
!skills/improve-codebase-architecture/**
!skills/guide-decision/
!skills/guide-decision/**
!skills/guide-purchase/
!skills/guide-purchase/**
!skills/search-first/
!skills/search-first/**
!skills/token-codebase-exploration/
!skills/token-codebase-exploration/**
!skills/token-file-ops/
!skills/token-file-ops/**
!skills/teach/
!skills/teach/**
!skills/verify-sources/
!skills/verify-sources/**
!skills/write-french/
!skills/write-french/**
!skills/write-guide/
!skills/write-guide/**
